#: includes/components/query-builder/templates/admin/edit.php:46
msgid ""
"Optional. Set custom Query ID to connect this query with JetSmartFilters. To"
" work correctly this Query ID should be the same as Query ID set in the "
"filter settings and ID of appropriate widget where this query is used."
msgstr ""
"اختیاری. برای اتصال این کوئری با JetSmartFilters، شناسه کوئری سفارشی را "
